                "text": "Michigan families are paying too much for insulin.\n\nLast year, I passed a new law to cap the cost of insulin at $35 a month for seniors on Medicare. My new legislation would cap the cost of insulin for all Americans, regardless of coverage. https://t.co/z4YE4yTeYt",
