                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Starting this month, no senior on Medicare will pay more than $35 a month for insulin!\n\nThis is a huge victory, but the fight isn\u2019t over. I\u2019ll continue leading efforts to cap the cost of insulin for ALL Americans, because lifesaving medication shouldn\u2019t cost your life savings. https://t.co/jL19I7KYiu",
