                "text": "88 years ago, #SocialSecurity was created. Hardworking Michiganders contribute to Social Security with every paycheck\u2014it\u2019s an insurance program, not a handout. \n\nI will defend against any attempts to privatize or cut Social Security. Michiganders deserve to retire with dignity. https://t.co/wdLy43vFjW",
