                "text": "No Michigander should have to choose between putting food on the table or filling a prescription.\n\nToday\u2019s announcement is a historic step from the #InflationReductionAct to take on Big Pharma & lower prescription drug costs for all Michiganders.\nhttps://t.co/oUdkUOR1W7",
