                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare open enrollment has begun! From now until Dec. 7th, you can review your current plan & make changes at https://t.co/649NALsyUQ or by calling 1-800-MEDICARE.\n\nBecause of legislation I helped pass, seniors will see lower health care costs when they choose their 2024 plans. https://t.co/etQWAQKAhV",
