                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Americans shouldn\u2019t have to ration life-saving medication that costs just a few dollars to make.\n\nDemocrats passed a law capping insulin at just $35/month for Medicare beneficiaries. We must continue putting pressure on Big Pharma until insulin is affordable for all.",
