                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It\u2019s an honor to serve Michigan's 8th District in Congress. In 2023, my office worked hard to make your voice heard and assist in issues with Medicare, veterans\u2019 benefits, tax refunds, Social Security, passports and more.\n\nI look forward to continuing this work in 2024! https://t.co/gf9ubShHR8",
