                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thanks to new laws passed by Democrats in Congress and President Biden, we are lowering prescription drug costs. \n\nMichigan seniors on average will save $356 a year on the Rx prices because we\u2019re finally letting Medicare negotiate drug prices with Big Pharma.",
