                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare & Medicaid help give millions the security and dignity of affordable health care. @VP and Democrats passed laws to strengthen these insurance programs.\n\nUnder their extreme Project 2025 plan, former President Trump and House GOP would cut Medicare & Social Security. https://t.co/cvbLX1TLs5",
