                "text": "The Republicans' extreme Project 2025 seeks to control women's bodies, strip us of our fundamental freedoms, cut Social Security and Medicare, and give the wealthy and corporations more power. \n\nThis agenda isn't just weird\u2014it\u2019s dangerous. https://t.co/YU85sPETUl",
