                "text": "Happy Birthday, Social Security! More than 2 million Michiganders rely on this vital insurance program.\n\nRepublicans want to raise the retirement age and make devastating cuts to Social Security.\n\n@VP & Democrats will protect this vital program so you can retire with dignity. https://t.co/kuip0EN4yQ",
