                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thanks to @POTUS, @VP, and Democrats in Congress, millions of Americans are paying less for prescription drugs. Starting this month, Medicare enrollees will see savings on over 50 different prescription drugs\u2014meaning more money back in their pockets.\n\nI am proud to support legislation like the Inflation Reduction Act, which has helped ensure more people can afford the care they need.\nhttps://t.co/jgwOC4ycd0",
