                "text": "Medicare open enrollment has begun!\n\nFrom now until December 7th, you can review your current health insurance plan and make changes at https://t.co/HtK8GDoE8a or by calling 1-800-MEDICARE.\n\nThanks to legislation passed by Democrats and @VP, in 2025, seniors on Medicare will pay no more than $35 a month for insulin, receive recommended vaccines for free, and see a $2,000 cap on their out-of-pocket drug costs.",
